ing your tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating a stage Boss, you can reclaim the power the Vtubers have lost and strengthen them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each stage run, players can unlock companions\u2019 innate abilities by upgrading certain stats, gaining new passive skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features many otherworldly invasion events that spawn randomly at specific times, offering different arena effects and modes\u2014such as timed capture, calamity triggers, summoning otherworldly monsters, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By clearing these challenges, players gain upgrades. You\u2019ll need to keep exploring the map to discover these areas, take on invasion events for extra rewards or abilities, add unpredictability, and test your real-time decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/dbeb056a893170f3a2c0745ff624bc83.poster.avif?t=1774515309\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/dbeb056a893170f3a2c0745ff624bc83.webm?t=1774515309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/dbeb056a893170f3a2c0745ff624bc83.mp4?t=1774515309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VTuber culture, DD is a very common term that comes from the Japanese phrase &quot;\u8ab0\u3067\u3082\u5927\u597d\u304d&quot; (Daredemo Daisuki), which means &quot;love everyone.&quot; Simply put, DD is used to describe fans who like many different VTubers, rather than focusing their support on just one VTuber.</p>","developers":["\u96f6\u96f6"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descr